/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3025\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91\" title=\"星锑\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91\" title=\"星锑\"><img alt=\"星锑\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-302501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/52/HeadIconSmall-302501.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%98%9F%E9%94%91\" title=\"星锑\">星锑</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.1</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>银行</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>绿茵的盛典</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：302503</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">英格兰！<br />时隔多年，世界杯的举办地回到了这片现代足球萌生的土地。雷米特金杯奇迹般地失而复得，小狮子威利刚问世便得到人们的追捧，好小伙子们一路高唱着凯歌杀入决赛。此刻，“足球高于生死”，人们在脸上涂抹油彩、挥舞旗帜，为出乎意料的帽子戏法而欢呼雀跃，为加时赛惊险攻入的进球争吵和喧嚷，而胜负揭晓后，还为捍卫各自队伍的荣誉而彼此投掷焰火棒和酒瓶。<br />……等等，投掷什么？<br />身披圣乔治十字旗的摇滚海盗跳了起来，为自己冠上新的头衔：<br />“足球海盗在此，可别放任他们为所欲为！今天的庆典不允许任何人发动战争！”</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"302503\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e8/Belonging-302504.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">海盗的礼帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Pirate Hat</div></div></div><div>无估值<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶据称“混合了时下球迷流行风尚，与无往不利的摇滚海盗审美”的特别礼帽。星锑背包上的小装饰也被利用起来，充当丰富挂链色彩的点睛部件。整体搭配元素复杂，但好在成品看上去不算凌乱。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302505.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/2/23/Belonging-302505.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">主场应援球衣<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Soccer Jersey</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />113<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>购置于帝国球场附近足球用品店的主场球队球衣，球迷特供版。<br />宣称“仅此一件”的孤品，似乎不可避免地因为断码而显得过大。所幸，穿着它的人完全不在乎合身与否。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-302506.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/53/Belonging-302506.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">流动的旗帜<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Flag</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />6.5<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>偶尔会被星锑用来当作披肩的主场旗帜。看起来比常见的缎面旗帜更长，面料也更加光滑。当然，如果你有幸见到那抹欢乐的身影，你会明白，最具感染力的显然不是旗帜本身。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%901.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 狂热分子1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%901.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%901.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%901.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%901.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/43/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%901.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%901.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%902.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 狂热分子2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%902.jpg/216px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%902.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"216\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%902.jpg/325px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%902.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ab/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%902.jpg/433px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E7%8B%82%E7%83%AD%E5%88%86%E5%AD%902.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1620\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">狂热分子 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Fierce Fan</small></span></span>"}}